RELEASE kicom version="0.8.0"
FEATURE "Authenticated human-gated self-update controller"
FEATURE "ZIP path/symlink/unmanifested-file rejection and MANIFEST.sha256 verification"
FEATURE "Complete pre-update snapshot of every touched code file and post-update integrity/HELLO healthcheck"
FEATURE "Automatic snapshot restoration on update failure"
RULE "var and stage are always preserved"
RULE "no unconditional KCL self-update mutation"
END_RELEASE kicom
